@host = http://localhost:5024

### Rejestracja nowego użytkownika
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "test1234"
}

### Logowanie
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "test1234"
}

### Lista zadań (wklej token z logowania)
GET {{host}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer TU_WKLEJ_TOKEN

### Dodanie zadania
POST {{host}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer TU_WKLEJ_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test z API",
  "description": "Zadanie dodane przez plik .http",
  "status": "todo",
  "dueDate": "2026-11-15"
}

### Zmiana zadania
PUT {{host}}/api/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer TU_WKLEJ_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test z API",
  "description": "Zmieniony opis",
  "status": "in_progress",
  "dueDate": "2026-11-15"
}

### Komentarze do zadania
GET {{host}}/api/tasks/1/comments
Authorization: Bearer TU_WKLEJ_TOKEN
